[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892219\">7045A10</a>\n                                           (left side)</p><p>1. Release the retaining buttons using the special tool.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.077.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolts.</p><p>3. Remove the cover.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035513.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. Move the unit slightly and disconnect the electrical connections\n(from 1a to 1h).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Navigator control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M90A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Navigator control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M90B</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Navigator control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M90C</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1d</p></td><td><p>Navigator control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M90D</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1e</p></td><td><p>Navigator control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M90E</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1f</p></td><td><p>Navigator control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M90F</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1g</p></td><td><p>Navigator control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M90G</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1h</p></td><td><p>Navigator control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M90H</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Remove the unit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035514.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. If necessary, undo the bolts (1a) and remove the feeder (1b).</p><p>2. If necessary, undo the bolts (2a) and remove the CDlayer/control\nunit (2b).</p><p>3. Recover the earth cable.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035514.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the CD player and\ncontrol unit for the on-board navigator are not damaged.</p><p>If the CD player/control unit and earth\nlead is removed, place it in position and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>If the feeder is removed, place it in position\nand secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Position the unit on the vehicle floor\nand connect the electrical connections.</p><p>Position the cover and fix it using the\nbolts.</p><p>Engage the retaining buttons.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892219\">7045A10</a>\n                                           (left\nside)</p><p>Carry out the satellite navigator &#x27;Menù\nTest&#x27; (\n                                          <a href=\"#/2888296\">5580M</a>\n                                           ).</p>"]]